      "writtenOn": "2017-05-11T23:20:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With the stop bit below, is this effectively adding 2 slop bits, so your data transfer will be ~10% slower than it could be? Maybe a compromise would be 1.1 or 1.5 stop bits below and take this out?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 180,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 180,
        "endChar": 22
